Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Sat Nov 9 13:02:27 2024 +1100

    Timing tests should use a threshold.

    The stats tests were using an exact value for a timing statistic,
    which results in flakey results. Instead, let's set a small
    maximum threshold.

diff --git a/openstack/tests/unit/test_stats.py b/openstack/tests/unit/test_stats.py
