           - ``g`` gauge
           - ``ms`` timing
           - ``s`` set
+
+        Note that for ``ms`` type, you are expressing a maximum value,
+        not an exact value. This is to avoid flakey tests.
         """

         self.assertIsNotNone(self.statsd)
